WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.922 --> 00:00:03.762
RAMONDA
We know what you whisper.

00:00:05.711 --> 00:00:08.717
They have lost their protector.

00:00:09.633 --> 00:00:12.479
Now is our time to strike.

00:00:12.530 --> 00:00:14.522
♪♪

00:00:14.573 --> 00:00:16.650
OKOYE
You saw an underwater empire?

00:00:19.016 --> 00:00:21.328
SHURI
Yes. These people are dangerous.

00:00:23.117 --> 00:00:24.967
RAMONDA
There is a new world power at play.

00:00:26.727 --> 00:00:28.946
NAMOR
Are you an ally or an enemy?

00:00:31.930 --> 00:00:33.852
SHURI
He's coming for the surface world.

00:00:51.773 --> 00:00:54.555
M'BAKU
The Black Panther lives!

